 <h3><u>Aajawo ali asger</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Aajawo ali asger</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <font size=4> <p>(Aajawo ali asger) x3</p> <p>(Maa jula julaye) x4</p> <p>Raato ko uth kar lori sunaye hai,</p> <p>Ay phool sa sipahi,</p> <p>Tujko salaam mera,</p> <p>Tune kiya hai uncha,</p> <p>Dunya me naam mera,</p> <p>Aajawo tuje maa sine se lagaye hai,</p> <p>(Maa jula julaye) x2</p> <p>Amu hai paas tere,</p> <p>Baba hai aur akber,</p> <p>Darna na zalimo se,</p> <p>Ay be zuban asger,</p> <p>Maa ko bulaana jab nind na aye hai,</p> <p>(Maa jula julaye) x2</p> <p>Maa teri tashnagi par,</p> <p>Qurbaan meri jaani,</p> <p>Kyu beh rahaa hai darya,</p> <p>Tujko mila na pani,</p> <p>Aaja ke madar paani pilaye hai,</p> <p>(Maa jula julaye) x2</p> <p>Tu chaand mere ghar ka,</p> <p>Dunya se jane waale,</p> <p>Tu kya gaya hai gar se,</p> <p>Rukhsat hu ye ujaale,</p> <p>Taarikiyo ke badal se chhaaye hai,</p> <p>(Maa jula julaye) x2</p> <p>Awlaad ka bicharna,</p> <p>Sab se baraa hai sadma,</p> <p>Ujri hai kokh meri, </p> <p>dil ro raha hai mera,</p> <p>yeh aag dil ki maa kaise bujaye hai,</p> <p>(Maa jula julaye) x2</p> <p>madar ke samne jab,</p> <p>paani ka jaam aye,</p> <p>besaakh ta labo par,</p> <p>tera hi naam aaye,</p> <p>paani me tera chehra nazar aaye hai,</p> <p>(Maa jula julaye) x2</p> <p>Dil se nikal rahi hai,</p> <p>Ab yeh duwae har pal,</p> <p>Maa ban ke tujko paale,</p> <p>Ye sar zamine maktal,</p> <p>Darti hu laykin tu khof na khaye hai </p> <p>(Maa jula julaye) x2</p> <p>Sunti hu rodiya tha,</p> <p>Tuj par sitam ka lashkar,</p> <p>Tu muskura raha tha,</p> <p>Jis waqt teer kha kar,</p> <p>Kayse tuje maa dilse bhulaye hai,</p></font>
  <p></p> 
